#. module: deltatech_obyc_landed_cost
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:deltatech_obyc_landed_cost.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"How a landed cost entry that would credit a class 6 (expense) account is "
"generated. 'Through intermediary account' routes the class 6 credit through "
"a technical account, producing two balanced entries with the same net "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Cum se generează nota costului adițional care ar credita un cont de clasa 6 "
"(cheltuieli). „Prin cont intermediar” trece creditul clasei 6 printr-un cont"
" tehnic și produce două note echilibrate, cu același efect net."

#. module: deltatech_obyc_landed_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_obyc_landed_cost.field_res_company__landed_cost_method
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_obyc_landed_cost.field_res_config_settings__landed_cost_method
msgid ""
"How a landed cost entry that would credit a class 6 (expense) account is generated:\n"
"- Standard: native Odoo behaviour (stock valuation = class 6);\n"
"- Through intermediary account: the class 6 credit is routed through a technical intermediary account, producing two balanced entries (stock valuation = intermediary and intermediary = class 6) with the same net effect."
msgstr ""
"Cum se generează nota costului adițional care ar credita un cont de clasa 6 "
"(cheltuieli). „Prin cont intermediar” trece creditul clasei 6 printr-un cont"
" tehnic și produce două note echilibrate, cu același efect net."

