#. module: deltatech_obyc_landed_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_obyc_landed_cost.field_res_company__landed_cost_intermediary_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_obyc_landed_cost.field_res_config_settings__landed_cost_intermediary_account_id
msgid ""
"Technical account used to route the class 6 credit of a landed cost entry. "
"It nets to zero on every landed cost. Class 609 is never rerouted."
msgstr ""
"Cont tehnic prin care trece creditul clasei 6 al notei costului adițional. "
"Se stinge (sold zero) la fiecare cost adițional. Clasa 609 nu se rutează "
"niciodată."

